          ],
          "title": "LIVE Q&A meetings",
          "slug": "live-q-a-meetings",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3853,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\n\t.container-border {\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #ccc;\r\n\t\tborder-radius: 15px;\r\n\t\tpadding-top: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-right: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-bottom: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-left: 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\tPlanning, knitting and comple a basic pullover sweater. This course is designed for all knitters, no matter what your skill level.<br>Included is the updated Prickly Pear Pullover pattern (formerly known as the Child's Simple Rolled Neck Pullover)<br>The sweater shape is simple. The plan is to take it step-by-step. The goal is to FINISH\r\n\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Choose your size</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Choose your yarn</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Plan YOUR design (no changes mid-stream)</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Focus on each section</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Learn/practice techniques</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>FINISH your sweater</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\r\n\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail zoom\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/64/child_rolled_nile.jpg\">\r\n\r\n<br><div>\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\">\r\n\t\t<span class=\"section-title MachineknittingColor\">Are you NEW?</span><br>Knit the pattern \"as is\" focusing on learning/perfecting techniques used for the design. Don't over-complicate things.<br><b>The goal is to FINISH the sweater and build your confidence with your machine</b><br></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\">\r\n\t\t<span class=\"section-title MachineknittingColor\">Ready for an adventure?</span><br>Use this simple pattern as a canvas for your creativity. Challenge yourself to try a new-to-you stitch pattern technique. How about Intarsia? Color Blocks? Knit the entire garment in Fisherman Rib. <br>\r\n\t\tBecause the shaping is basic, you can <b>focus on the new technique and expand your skills.</b><br></div>\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 5766,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
