            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Knit it Now Perfect Fit™ Patterns are the next-generation of machine knitting patterns. <br><ul>\r\n<li>You choose the machine</li>\r\n<li>Your yarn choice</li>\r\n<li>Use YOUR gauge</li>\r\n<li>Use ANY stitch pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wide range of sizes, Perfect Fit™ for you</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nThe patterns are designed to display on an iPad or tablet, but can also be downloaded and printed in a clear PDF format.<br>We don't use cryptic abbreviations.  We take you step by step through the knitting process.  <b>Included are tips and tricks and videos embedded right where you need them.</b><br>Please take 2 minutes to watch this walk through, and get an overview of our patterns so you will be ready to hit the ground running when you start knitting your Prickly Pear.",
              "legacyComponentId": 5757,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "374009611",
              "title": null,
              "legacyComponentId": 5758,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "New to Perfect Fit Patterns?",
          "slug": "new-to-perfect-fit-patterns",
          "order": 6,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3854,
            "blockType": "Video"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "You have your choice of patterns<br>\r\n<em>NOTE: The adult size patterns have back neck shaping.  The Kids Prickly Pear does not. If you are a new knitter and want to knit an easier adult sweater, simply ignore the back neck shaping. Questions? <a href=\"/elements/contactus.cfm\">Contact Us</a></em>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5759,
              "order": 1
            },
